    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45486" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐχείρωτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρόω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easy to master</i> or <i>overcome</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				452
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.3.4
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>easy to train</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ νομοθέτῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1332b9
				</span></i>
			; simply, <i>easy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				3.4
			</span></i>. (
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐχειρότερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					37.7
				</span></i>
			, and 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐχειρότατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					1.6.36
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Oec.</u>
				8.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.14.7
			</span></i>, are ff.ll. for -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωτότερος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
		-ωτότατος</span>.)</div>
